stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> ScannerReady
    state "Camera or manual QR entry ready" as ScannerReady
    state "Read QR and submit once" as ReadTicket
    state "Validate driver session and QR format" as ValidateRequest
    state "Lock ticket, booking and trip rows" as LockTicket
    state TicketResult <<choice>>
    state "Show invalid or unauthorized ticket" as Rejected
    state "Confirm successful payment and active trip today" as ValidateJourney
    state JourneyResult <<choice>>
    state "Booking paid to boarded; ticket boarded; save scanned_at" as CheckIn
    state "Insert check-in audit and commit transaction" as CommitCheckIn
    state "Already checked in; keep original scanned_at" as AlreadyBoarded
    state "Show check-in success and refresh passengers" as CheckInDisplayed

    ScannerReady --> ReadTicket : Camera detects QR or driver submits code
    ReadTicket --> ValidateRequest : POST /api/scan
    ValidateRequest --> Rejected : Missing session, wrong role or malformed QR
    ValidateRequest --> LockTicket : Driver and QR valid
    LockTicket --> TicketResult : Resolve ticket and assigned driver
    TicketResult --> Rejected : Ticket missing, wrong driver, unpaid or unusable booking
    TicketResult --> AlreadyBoarded : Payment success and booking already boarded
    TicketResult --> ValidateJourney : Payment success and booking paid
    ValidateJourney --> JourneyResult
    JourneyResult --> Rejected : Wrong Bangkok date, inactive trip or arrival passed
    JourneyResult --> CheckIn : Today's active waiting, departed or travelling trip
    CheckIn --> CommitCheckIn
    CommitCheckIn --> CheckInDisplayed : API returns boarded status and saved scan time
    AlreadyBoarded --> CheckInDisplayed : Return already_checked_in without another update
    CheckInDisplayed --> ScannerReady : Scan next ticket
    Rejected --> ScannerReady : Display API error and retry
    ScannerReady --> [*] : Driver leaves scanner

    note right of CheckIn
        Scanning checks the passenger in immediately.
        No separate confirmation button is required.
        Concurrent scans are serialized by row locks.
    end note
